<BaseLayout
  title="研究｜王雅萍 Ong Nga Ping"
  description="王雅萍副教授研究領域、學術著作、學位論文及論文指導"
>
  <main class="research-page">

    <!-- =====================================================
         HEADER
    ====================================================== -->

    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">RESEARCH</p>

      <h1>
        <span data-lang="zh">研究</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Research</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        <span data-lang="zh">
          王雅萍副教授的研究涵蓋民族教育、臺灣民族史、
          東南亞民族與現況、社區營造與民族學研究方法，
          並長期關注原住民族語言與教育、文化復振、
          地方社會及跨國田野實踐。
        </span>

        <span data-lang="en">
          Associate Professor Ong Nga Ping's research covers ethnic and
          Indigenous education, ethnic history of Taiwan, Southeast Asian
          studies, community development, and research methods in ethnology,
          with continuing interests in Indigenous languages, cultural
          revitalization, local communities, and transnational fieldwork.
        </span>
      </p>
    </header>


    <!-- =====================================================
         RESEARCH INTERESTS
    ====================================================== -->

    <section>
      <p class="section-label">RESEARCH INTERESTS</p>

      <h2>
        <span data-lang="zh">研究領域</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Research Interests</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="interest-grid">

        <article class="interest-card">
          <span class="number">01</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">民族與原住民族教育</span>
            <span data-lang="en">
              Ethnic & Indigenous Education
            </span>
          </h3>

          <p>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              原住民族教育政策、族語教育、課程發展、
              文化回應教學與高等教育中的原住民族教育。
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Indigenous education policy, language education,
              curriculum development, culturally responsive teaching,
              and Indigenous education in higher education.
            </span>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="interest-card">
          <span class="number">02</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">臺灣民族史</span>
            <span data-lang="en">Ethnic History of Taiwan</span>
          </h3>

          <p>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              從族群、地方與家族史角度探討臺灣歷史，
              包括原漢關係、地方文化及族譜研究。
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Taiwan history from ethnic, local, and family-history
              perspectives, including Indigenous–Han relations,
              local culture, and genealogy.
            </span>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="interest-card">
          <span class="number">03</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">東南亞民族與跨國研究</span>
            <span data-lang="en">
              Southeast Asia & Transnational Studies
            </span>
          </h3>

          <p>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              關注臺灣與東南亞之間的文化交流、
              社區發展、博物館、宗教及跨國田野實踐。
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Cultural exchange between Taiwan and Southeast Asia,
              community development, museums, religion,
              and transnational fieldwork.
            </span>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="interest-card">
          <span class="number">04</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">社區營造與文化復振</span>
            <span data-lang="en">
              Community Development & Cultural Revitalization
            </span>
          </h3>

          <p>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              以烏來等地方場域探討文化技藝傳承、
              織布復振、社區行動與地方實踐。
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Cultural transmission, weaving revitalization,
              community action, and place-based practice,
              particularly in areas such as Wulai.
            </span>
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="interest-card">
          <span class="number">05</span>

          <h3>
            <span data-lang="zh">民族學研究方法</span>
            <span data-lang="en">
              Research Methods in Ethnology
            </span>
          </h3>

          <p>
            <span data-lang="zh">
              民族誌、田野調查、口述歷史、檔案研究、
              質性研究與行動實踐。
            </span>

            <span data-lang="en">
              Ethnography, fieldwork, oral history,
              archival research, qualitative methods,
              and action-oriented research.
            </span>
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>


